Generated MPEG-4 Part 2 streams (deterministic lavfi sources). The
reference decodes come from the pinned FFmpeg when the tests run (see
tests/reference.rs).

ffmpeg 9.0.1:

    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=64x64:rate=25 -t 2 -c:v mpeg4 -bf 2 -g 6 -f m4v ipb_bf2_64x64.m4v
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=64x64:rate=25 -t 2 -c:v mpeg4 -flags +qpel -g 6 -f m4v qpel_64x64.m4v
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=64x64:rate=25 -t 2 -c:v mpeg4 -mbd rd -mpv_flags +qp_rd -g 6 -f m4v qp_rd_64x64.m4v
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=64x64:rate=25 -t 2 -c:v mpeg4 -flags +ildct+ilme -g 6 -f m4v ilaced_64x64.m4v
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=64x64:rate=25 -t 2 -c:v mpeg4 -bf 2 -flags +aic+qpel -g 6 -f m4v ipb_aic_qpel_64x64.m4v

FFmpeg 2da55bf (~/projects/ffmpeg-src/ffmpeg): 84x76 is past the
macroblock grid both ways, and the scroll moves the picture 6 and 5
pixels a frame, so vectors point past its edges:

    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=size=84x76:rate=25,scroll=v=-0.08:h=0.07" -t 2 -c:v mpeg4 -flags +mv4+qpel -mbd rd -bf 2 -g 12 -f m4v qpel_mv4_bf2_84x76.m4v
